Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.35,0:03:28.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Futaba, you brought lunch again today?}Futaba, ¿volviste a traer tu almuerzo hoy?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.43,0:03:31.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I just can't get myself to hit up the school shop again.}Todavía me da miedo volver a la tienda de la escuela.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.64,0:03:33.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Right, there's that lunch lady.}Cierto, está esa señora.{suena como pregunta}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.06,0:03:38.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You totally lucked out when that guy covered for you.}Pero tuviste mucha suerte de que \Nese chico apareciera para ayudarte.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.11,0:03:39.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I know, right?}{... ._.)\fad(0,300)}Cierto, cierto.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.45,0:03:42.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's not something to laugh about!}¡No es algo para reírse!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.32,0:03:45.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You two doubted me just as much as she did!}¡Ustedes también dudaron de mí tanto como ella!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.37,0:03:46.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Can you blame us?}¿Y qué querías?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.83,0:03:49.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No vimos lo que pasó.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.58,0:03:54.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,20,,{You're just pretending to be friends.}Es como si fingieras tener amigas. {orig: It's no better than} {actually, orig: It's like you're all just pretending to be friends.}{AHR #01 [0:20:31.26] :3}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.54,0:03:58.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Have you lost it, Futaba?}¿Qué estás haciendo, Futaba?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.13,0:03:59.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Makita.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.13,0:04:03.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Going somewhere else to eat your lunch again?}¿Hoy también comerás tu almuerzo en otro lado?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.63,0:04:05.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Where do you even eat?}¿En dónde es que comes?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.43,0:04:07.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Outside.}Afuera.{digamos}{Al aire libre}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.10,0:04:11.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I have a little picnic with my friends from another class.}Tendré un {\i1}picnic{\i0\fscx50}{\fscx100} con mis amigos de la otra clase.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.35,0:04:12.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's pretty fun.}Es muy divertido.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.23,0:04:16.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So cute I'm gonna die...}Qué linda es...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.61,0:04:18.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{God, she ticks me off.}Dios, me tiene harta.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.19,0:04:21.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No sé qué rayos le ven los \Nchicos a tipas cursis como esa.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.86,0:04:23.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, who's on duty?}Oigan, ¿quién está a cargo?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.66,0:04:25.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That's me.}Yo.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.91,0:04:28.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I've got your class's homework and printouts.}Tengo la tarea de su clase y unas impresiones.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.49,0:04:30.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Come pick them up at the faculty office.}Ven a recogerlo a la sala de profesores.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.08,0:04:31.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Okay, got it.}Oh, sí.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.71,0:04:37.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sounds like it's gonna be heavy.}Suena a que son cosas pesadas.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.17,0:04:39.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Entonces ¿me ayudas?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.30,0:04:41.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Do your best, Futaba.}Esfuérzate, Futaba. {}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.01,0:04:42.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{See ya later.}Que te vaya bien.{Nos vemos luego.}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.51,0:04:47.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's so cold!}¡Qué frío!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.52,0:04:54.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,¿Makita-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.77,0:05:02.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It wouldn't kill you to eat inside when it's this cold.}No te hará mal comer adentro si hace mucho frío.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.90,0:05:06.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The sun's out today, so it's actually pretty comfortable.}Pero el sol salió, se siente muy agradable.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.78,0:05:09.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Claro que no! ¡Si hace bastante frío!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.45,0:05:15.67,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Sin duda, cualquiera diría que es bonita.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.54,0:05:20.59,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Oh, it's like my old one.}Oh, es como el mío.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.47,0:05:29.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Um, you can have this if you'd like. It's an extra.}Eh, {Oye}si quieres te puedes quedar con este otro que tengo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.14,0:05:32.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But that kind of thing doesn't really suit me.}Pero eso no se vería bien conmigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.39,0:05:34.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That doesn't matter.}Eso no tiene nada que ver.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.43,0:05:36.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Take it.}Toma.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.02,0:05:39.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Well, thanks.}Bueno, gracias.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.40,0:05:43.11,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Wow, her hands are ice-cold.}Vaya, tiene las manos heladas.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.40,0:05:46.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks for coming to talk with me.}Gracias por{venir a} hablarme.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.74,0:05:50.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It means a lot, since all the girls seem to hate me.}Después de todo,\N pareciera que todo el mundo me odiara. {I think this goes with the previous line, as in "thanks for talking to me even though everyone hates me"}{:3}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.62,0:05:55.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I know I come off as trying too hard to appear cute.}Sé que me esfuerzo mucho en querer verme bien.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.71,0:06:00.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's because I get nervous in front of boys and end up putting on a front.}{Pero es}Es que me pongo nerviosa cuando los chicos me hablan y por eso actúo así.{http://i.imgur.com/Zh3wniX.png .-.}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.75,0:06:06.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But the reason everyone else dresses up and uses makeup}Pero la razón por la que todas se visten bien y usan maquillaje
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.17,0:06:08.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{is to look good for others, right?}es para que otros las noten, ¿verdad?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.01,0:06:15.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{How is that different from me trying to look cute in front of the boys?}¿Qué diferencia hay entre eso y que yo actúe bonita frente a los chicos?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.60,0:06:25.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{If I had to say, it's because when you try to look good only for the guys...}Veamos, es porque cuando intentas verte bien solo para los chicos...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.24,0:06:31.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Wait, don't I do the exact same thing, except with girls?}Espera,{¿Qué?} ¿no es lo mismo que \Nhago yo pero con las chicas?{e_e}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.78,0:06:37.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I don't really feel the need to deny that others find me annoying.}No puedo negar el hecho de que puedo parecer molesta para algunas personas.{uh...}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.04,0:06:41.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{All I want is to continue to be who I want to be.}Pero a cambio de eso, \Npuedo vivir mi vida como me gusta.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.84,0:06:48.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Here, a hand warmer.}Toma, úsalo.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.68,0:06:54.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Take it as thanks for the bunny strap. It's not as cute, though.}Acéptalo como agradecimiento por el conejito.\N Aunque no sea igual de lindo.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.56,0:06:57.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks again!}¡Gracias otra vez!{Gracias por el colgante/la correa}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.02,0:07:07.57,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I guess if you were to put a label on me, I'd be "anti-cutesy"?}Ya veo. Creo que soy lo opuesto a verme bonita.{¿Recién se da cuenta?}{ah}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.20,0:07:14.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, are you listening to me?}Oye, ¿me estás escuchando?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.08,0:07:16.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, I hear you.}Sí, te escucho.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.24,0:07:20.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I told you, you better buckle down for finals.}Ya te dije que debes prepararte para los finales.
