Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.43,0:18:04.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I haven't been able to talk to Asumi or Chie-chan.}no he podido hablar con Asumi o Chie-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.19,0:18:11.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Time passed...}El tiempo pasó...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.11,0:18:16.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Stand. Bow.}De pie. Inclínense.{creo eso hacen}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.65,0:18:18.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm free!}¡Soy libre!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.20,0:18:19.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Finally!}¡Al fin!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.53,0:18:25.04,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Is this really what I want?}¿Esto es lo que en verdad quiero?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.25,0:18:31.42,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I mean, we probably won't even end up in the same class next year anyway...}Digo, probablemente no estemos\N en la misma clase el siguiente año...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.26,0:18:39.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Asumi, Chie-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.72,0:18:42.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah?}¿Qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.18,0:18:44.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{H-Hey...}E-Escuchen...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.10,0:18:47.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{S-Sorry about what happened.}L-Lamento lo que sucedió.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.23,0:18:50.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I shouldn't have said it like I did.}No debería haberlo dicho de esa manera.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.06,0:18:53.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But...}Pero...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.36,0:18:56.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Those were my true feelings.}Esos fueron mis verdaderos sentimientos.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.57,0:19:04.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\q2\I was always afraid you might hate me, so I never acted like myself,}Todo este tiempo tuve miedo de que me odiaran, \Nasí que nunca actué como soy en verdad,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.91,0:19:06.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{but that's...}pero así...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.71,0:19:10.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{...who I am.}es como soy.{es lo que siento.}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.51,0:19:18.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I get how you feel.}Entiendo cómo te sientes.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.09,0:19:24.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{And well, if that's how you really are,}Y bueno, si así es como eres en verdad,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.01,0:19:27.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I don't think we can be friends anymore.}no creo que podamos seguir siendo amigas.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.06,0:19:31.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm not saying you're a bad person or anything.}No digo que seas una mala persona o algo así.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.40,0:19:37.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's just... we don't go well together.}Es que... no creo que nos vayamos a llevar muy bien estando juntas.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.32,0:19:40.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.70,0:19:42.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Wait, Asumi!}¡Asumi!{"¡Asumi!" sin más quedaría bien.}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.57,0:19:44.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hold on!}¡Espérame!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.12,0:19:50.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.42,0:19:59.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You know how when we were younger...}Cuando eras pequeña...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.34,0:20:04.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{...our teachers told us to play nice with our friends?}¿tus maestros no dijeron que debías llevarte bien con tus compañeros?{Cuando era pequeña... un maestro me dijo que debía llevarme bien con mis compañeros.}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.68,0:20:09.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Back then, I wholeheartedly believed in those words.}Desde entonces, creí sinceramente en esas palabras.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.81,0:20:11.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But now...}Pero...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.06,0:20:14.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Las cosas no siempre salen como uno quisiera, ¿no?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.15,0:20:19.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What the teachers never told us}Lo que los maestros nunca nos dijeron
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.07,0:20:22.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{was what to do when everything failed.}fue qué hacer cuando todo fracasara.{qué hacer cuando nada funcione.}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.41,0:20:26.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka-sa—
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.07,0:20:29.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{There are some things that you can't change! That's obvious!}¡Pero hay cosas que no se pueden evitar! {->}¡Es obvio!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.62,0:20:34.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I...}Yo...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.50,0:20:40.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{There are so many things I want to talk with you about.}quisiera hablar de muchas cosas contigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.92,0:20:42.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Me too!}¡Yo igual!{también}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.89,0:20:46.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{See you!}¡Nos vemos!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.10,0:20:47.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, bye-bye.}Sí,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.72,0:20:48.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, bye-bye.}{\i1}bye-bye{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.06,0:20:56.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'll keep on learning things I was never taught.}Seguiré aprendiendo cosas que nunca me han enseñado.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.40,0:21:03.65,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)}Hoy aprendí que para tomar una decisión firme,\N debes armarte de valor.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.07,0:21:09.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'm stronger now than I was back then.}Ahora soy más fuerte que antes.{creo habla de su pasado, esto no pasa en el mangu )?}{>Manga}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.58,0:21:16.21,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I wonder why...}Me pregunto por qué...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.83,0:21:19.34,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Why do I have this incredible urge}¿Por qué tengo este deseo increíble
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.13,0:21:22.01,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{to go see Kou?}de ver a Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.59,0:21:25.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Not the Tanaka-kun I knew in middle school,}No al Tanaka-kun que conocí en secundaria,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.47,0:21:27.01,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{but the Kou of today.}sino al Kou de hoy.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.26,0:21:33.23,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I want to feel the sense of bonding that we shared that moment}Quiero volver a sentir lo que \Ncompartimos en ese momento,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.23,0:21:35.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{one more time!}¡una vez más!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.61,0:21:44.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Did he go home already?}¿Se habrá ido ya a casa?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:45.03,0:21:46.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Who're you looking for?}¿Qué estás buscando?{buscando}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.45,0:21:54.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Kou!
